omaFace includes or builds on work by others:

Omarchy (https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy), MIT License,
Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson.
  - sddm/Main.qml and the images in sddm/ are Omarchy's login screen with the
    omaFace mark added.
  - The lock screen and polkit dialog are not copied into this repository:
    install.sh builds them on your machine from Omarchy's installed files plus
    the patches in tools/patches.py.

Face models, downloaded by install.sh from OpenCV Zoo
(https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo) and checked against models/SHA256SUMS;
not redistributed here:
  - YuNet face detector (face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx), MIT License.
  - SFace face recognizer (face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx), Apache License 2.0.

For laptops without an IR camera, also downloaded and checked, not
redistributed:
  - Silent-Face anti-spoofing models MiniFASNetV2 and MiniFASNetV1SE by
    Minivision (https://github.com/minivision-ai/Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing),
    Apache License 2.0, in the ONNX export at
    https://github.com/yakhyo/face-anti-spoofing (Apache License 2.0).
  - MediaPipe iris landmark model by Google
    (https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe), Apache License 2.0.
  - Gaze estimation model MobileOne-S0 (Gaze360) from
    https://github.com/yakhyo/gaze-estimation, MIT License.

OpenCV (https://opencv.org), Apache License 2.0, used as a system library.
